(6153228, 907697, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great texture, great sky. I love the 50/50 split, like a yin &amp; yang that really nails home the S. Excellent photo.</td>', 'Great texture, great sky. I love the 50/50 split, like a yin & yang that really nails home the S. Excellent photo.', '2010-09-06 08:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6153229, 907542, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great find. Nice lines. Looks like a shot I''d try to take but mess up. I personally would have camped out a bit so that family didn''t pop into the shot, as I don''t think they add much. Either way, I like it. Curious to see where this is, as it looks exactly like my town (or at least like something that would be in my town).</td>', 'Great find. Nice lines. Looks like a shot I''d try to take but mess up. I personally would have camped out a bit so that family didn''t pop into the shot, as I don''t think they add much. Either way, I like it. Curious to see where this is, as it looks exactly like my town (or at least like something that would be in my town).', '2010-09-06 08:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6153230, 907811, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Excellent focal point, great tones. Nice curves. One of the better entries for sure.<br/> <br/>In other news, this would have been a good Misquotes entry, because as soon as I saw Rhythm/Treble, the first thing that came to mind was Public Enemy''s <i>The Rhythm, the Rebel</i> from Rebel Without a Pause. <i>The Rhythm, the Treble</i> would have gotten a good vote from me at least. (Sadly I''m not voting in this one, but this deserves high marks regardless).</td>', 'Great photo. Excellent focal point, great tones. Nice curves. One of the better entries for sure. In other news, this would have been a good Misquotes entry, because as soon as I saw Rhythm/Treble, the first thing that came to mind was Public Enemy''s The Rhythm, the Rebel from Rebel Without a Pause. The Rhythm, the Treble would have gotten a good vote from me at least. (Sadly I''m not voting in this one, but this deserves high marks regardless).', '2010-09-06 08:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6153231, 907725, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The bright white lines really hammer it home. Terrific mood. This will be at or near the top.</td>', 'Beautiful. The bright white lines really hammer it home. Terrific mood. This will be at or near the top.', '2010-09-06 08:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
