(6153266, 907600, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that soft blur of the sky that a long exposure brings.  The blue light trail is a great color contrast to the gold buildings and pink/purple sky.</td>', 'I like that soft blur of the sky that a long exposure brings.  The blue light trail is a great color contrast to the gold buildings and pink/purple sky.', '2010-09-06 09:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
