(6153900, 907797, 65319, '<td valign="top">If I saw this photo without knowing it was yours...I''d give it an 8! Really love this one, Bear! The background yellow bothers me slightly and reminds me of that old 1950''s greenish / yellow wall color. So, that would be my only nattering naybob nitpick. Color in this photo is a huge strength and you should make the most of it. The color in the fork itself...PERFECTION!<br/> <br/>As for composition, I can''t help but wonder how the fork would look at a stronger diagonal. Okay...so this is my third penny on on top of my two cents...;-) <br/> <br/>Good Luck, Dear...::Beams at Bear!::</td>', 'If I saw this photo without knowing it was yours...I''d give it an 8! Really love this one, Bear! The background yellow bothers me slightly and reminds me of that old 1950''s greenish / yellow wall color. So, that would be my only nattering naybob nitpick. Color in this photo is a huge strength and you should make the most of it. The color in the fork itself...PERFECTION! As for composition, I can''t help but wonder how the fork would look at a stronger diagonal. Okay...so this is my third penny on on top of my two cents...;-)  Good Luck, Dear...::Beams at Bear!::', '2010-09-06 20:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
