(6156849, 907193, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very nice spiral but S? I''m probably just missing it.  5.<br/> <br/>I''ve come back to have a better look and realised I was wrong with my first assessment.  I''m led nicely to the centre and the B&amp;W works wonderfully. Bumped to an 8.</td>', 'Very nice spiral but S? I''m probably just missing it.  5. I''ve come back to have a better look and realised I was wrong with my first assessment.  I''m led nicely to the centre and the B&W works wonderfully. Bumped to an 8.', '2010-09-08 19:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
