(6160089, 906592, 67697, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this but I will tell you my interpretation of "through the image".  I was looking for something that would wind it''s way into the depth of the scene and force me to continue looking even further.  <br/> <br/>I can certainly see the S-Shape.  And this is totally a fantastic capture.  I believe that this is the type of shot that would have done amazingly well in a FS challenge.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this but I will tell you my interpretation of "through the image".  I was looking for something that would wind it''s way into the depth of the scene and force me to continue looking even further.   I can certainly see the S-Shape.  And this is totally a fantastic capture.  I believe that this is the type of shot that would have done amazingly well in a FS challenge.', '2010-09-13 01:09:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6160090, 907725, 32997, '<td valign="top">this is very good news for this site...always a pleasure seeing your work...</td>', 'this is very good news for this site...always a pleasure seeing your work...', '2010-09-13 01:09:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6160106, 907748, 44877, '<td valign="top">I look at the top and the bottom - so here you are with the brown. However, your image is awesome. It''s an eclectic take on the topic - definitely a worthy image and clearly wildly underappreciated. The PH Yellow is sweet and I am glad you got that acknowledgment. Yellowy-brown - heh!</td>', 'I look at the top and the bottom - so here you are with the brown. However, your image is awesome. It''s an eclectic take on the topic - definitely a worthy image and clearly wildly underappreciated. The PH Yellow is sweet and I am glad you got that acknowledgment. Yellowy-brown - heh!', '2010-09-13 01:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6160109, 907867, 44877, '<td valign="top">I love this - what a quirky take on the challenge. Too bad it landed at the bottom of the heap.</td>', 'I love this - what a quirky take on the challenge. Too bad it landed at the bottom of the heap.', '2010-09-13 01:18:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6160119, 907797, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, I see I was the only critic of this, Robert. At least the only one who left more than a vote. (It was a 5, BTW) I love what you did with this, and if the topic had been s-curve without the description of it being a compositional technique, then it would have fit to a "T" and gotten a very high vote from me. <br/> <br/>This does reinforce my belief that having a visually strong image is a much greater factor on DPC than meeting all possible interpretations of the topic. <br/> <br/>Well played.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-13 00:27:22.</i></td>', 'Well, I see I was the only critic of this, Robert. At least the only one who left more than a vote. (It was a 5, BTW) I love what you did with this, and if the topic had been s-curve without the description of it being a compositional technique, then it would have fit to a "T" and gotten a very high vote from me.  This does reinforce my belief that having a visually strong image is a much greater factor on DPC than meeting all possible interpretations of the topic.  Well played.', '2010-09-13 01:26:46.000000', '2010-09-13 01:27:22.000000', 0),
(6160121, 907797, 100831, '<td valign="top">terrific!</td>', 'terrific!', '2010-09-13 01:29:18.000000', NULL, 0),
