(6160929, 907769, 8171, '<td valign="top">Many thanks - was great fun to do - I didn''t really see the potential in it until I noticed it was quite dark when converted to mono.  It was actually taken in the daytime but I just accentuated the darkness selectively and lightened the driver using the dodge tool. Cheers for the posthumous ribbon!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-13 16:49:47.</i></td>', 'Many thanks - was great fun to do - I didn''t really see the potential in it until I noticed it was quite dark when converted to mono.  It was actually taken in the daytime but I just accentuated the darkness selectively and lightened the driver using the dodge tool. Cheers for the posthumous ribbon!', '2010-09-13 17:10:10.000000', '2010-09-13 17:49:47.000000', 0),
