(6162626, 907344, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rugman1969:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice job Hahn.  But what happened to the lights about half way up on the straight stretch?  It''s like they disappeared and the started again? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Those are car taillights.  When the back of the car was visible to the camera, the taillights were more visible.  When the side of the car turned towards the camera, the taillights were less visible.  Seems obvious to me.</td>', 'Originally posted by rugman1969: Nice job Hahn.  But what happened to the lights about half way up on the straight stretch?  It''s like they disappeared and the started again?  Those are car taillights.  When the back of the car was visible to the camera, the taillights were more visible.  When the side of the car turned towards the camera, the taillights were less visible.  Seems obvious to me.', '2010-09-15 08:58:29.000000', NULL, 0),
