(7049678, 907845, 87278, '<td valign="top">Brilliant one I stumbled upon while checking out your prize winner on ''Subtlety''. I love your minimalist approach of just capturing the curve the defines the shape instead of going for the full shape. Very suggestive and leaves it to the viewer to fill the rest with his/her imagination. As posthumous said aptly "anything less is merely a photograph of architecture."</td>', 'Brilliant one I stumbled upon while checking out your prize winner on ''Subtlety''. I love your minimalist approach of just capturing the curve the defines the shape instead of going for the full shape. Very suggestive and leaves it to the viewer to fill the rest with his/her imagination. As posthumous said aptly "anything less is merely a photograph of architecture."', '2013-06-08 05:43:10.000000', NULL, 0),
